  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nStep aboard the brand-new Princess S72, a striking blend of contemporary elegance and performance, now available for private charter in Phuket.\n\nDesigned for up to 8 guests, she features 4 exquisitely appointed cabins — 2 doubles and 2 convertible twins, 3 with en-suite bathrooms. Master suite offers a separate entrance for more privacy.\n\nCruising gracefully at 20 knots, the Princess S72 is perfect for island-hopping between Phang Nga, Krabi, and Phi Phi, or to more remote escapes of Lipe or Similan Islands.\n\nDays unfold on expansive decks ideal for sunbathing or relaxation, while evenings bring the pleasure of a gourmet dinner prepared by the onboard chef and served alfresco beneath the stars.\n\nIndulge in the care of a professional crew of 4 — captain, deckhand, stewardess, and chef — ensuring every detail is seamless.\n\nEnjoy high-speed Wi-Fi, fantastic sound system, and a full range of water toys: paddleboards, floats, fishing gear, underwater scooters, and Pirelli Jet Tender with a 90hp inboard engine accommodating up to 6 guests.\n\nPrincess S72 redefines the art of sophisticated island cruising in Thailand.",
